.TH QUIPU-REASON 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-reason \- Run Datalog rules to a fixpoint and persist the derivations
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu reason\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-rules\fR] [\fB\-\-reactive\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run Datalog rules to a fixpoint and persist the derivations
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-rules\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Rule set to load or evaluate
.TP
\fB\-\-reactive\fR
Use the reactive reasoner
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
